{
"file": 42,
"paths": [
"d002/f663"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "183f6957",
"en_raw": "What's wrong, with that gloomy face?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "f3868a92",
"en_raw": "...Sango, you'd better go"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "a137dcb4",
"en_raw": "have him finish it?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "94d88756",
"en_raw": "What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "af668f38",
"en_raw": "I have no obligation to go"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "116cb0c8",
"en_raw": "because they decided it"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "5216a87d",
"en_raw": "on their own"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "f0e4d787",
"en_raw": "So what are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "6d0b6f27",
"en_raw": "Those guys just want to laugh"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "a23bc818",
"en_raw": "at me for being a coward"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "0d803fd9",
"en_raw": "I mean, that's the truth, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "7487d0c1",
"en_raw": "Then I'll go!"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "09f5cd65",
"en_raw": "Go where?"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "8059862a",
"en_raw": "What are you"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "f2031a88",
"en_raw": "even talking about?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "7d24f9b2",
"en_raw": "The courage test!"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "710dc37d",
"en_raw": "It's happening tonight at the redevelopment site"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "70e3fa04",
"en_raw": "They're inviting girls, not just boys"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "cdc34e27",
"en_raw": "Nao, you're going into that place"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "50835689",
"en_raw": "full of ghosts at night?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "a16def2f",
"en_raw": "Isn't that a bit reckless?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "8d3add75",
"en_raw": "Yuasa and his gang have surely"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "9648ef0d",
"en_raw": "set up some tricks"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "4419db93",
"en_raw": "Whatever those guys do"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "c4f93eb6",
"en_raw": "isn't scary at all"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "3db4d431",
"en_raw": "Hmm, huh, I see"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "fd54d858",
"en_raw": "True, running away from that"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "0f44676f",
"en_raw": "would make you not a man"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "f5b5c1d5",
"en_raw": "But don't die of a heart attack"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "f8df72ea",
"en_raw": "At the redevelopment site, won't you"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "fba19102",
"en_raw": "run into the police on patrol?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "8f304595",
"en_raw": "This month is apparently"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "f15dc69f",
"en_raw": "Bicycle Theft Prevention Month"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "7dd9bd94",
"en_raw": "so they're not coming"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "dd0b5fcc",
"en_raw": "How convenient"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "6eb2f561",
"en_raw": "Nao, you get to go in the back"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "ecc7232b",
"en_raw": "Lucky"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "8d60e899",
"en_raw": "Will Sango and the others"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "ea6ee45f",
"en_raw": "come along too?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "6d311122",
"en_raw": "Of course, to watch"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "a454cacd",
"en_raw": "Hey Nao, are the people in your class"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "a39d8413",
"en_raw": "doing the courage test again"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "a24fe5ec",
"en_raw": "at the redevelopment site today?"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "7c166ce4",
"en_raw": "It's annoying to take the bait"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "1b36eda9",
"en_raw": "knowing they'll humiliate me"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "08686d10",
"en_raw": "but ignoring them is annoying too"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "355774fb",
"en_raw": "Hey, are you listening?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "1daea98b",
"en_raw": "Sango, stay out of this"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "9f539bcb",
"en_raw": "It's my problem"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "433691a9",
"en_raw": "I'll decide..."
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "8dceef6d",
"en_raw": "Yuasa's face...!"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "109b3563",
"en_raw": "I have new respect for you, Nao"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "36a33d4b",
"en_raw": "You do have"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "d6a2431b",
"en_raw": "courage sometimes"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "f1eefcaf",
"en_raw": "What do you mean, sometimes?"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "4fa3b3fa",
"en_raw": "I'm always the same"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "5620f3b8",
"en_raw": "Well, listen to you"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "157f7bbd",
"en_raw": "Fine, for today's Nao"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "edcc41d3",
"en_raw": "I'll let it slide"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "1ea17b00",
"en_raw": "But but but but"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "4e1cb8b8",
"en_raw": "why did Nao faint"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "108a0746",
"en_raw": "when he saw Kurumi?"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "c8f39742",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Courage Test"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "307be39f",
"en_raw": "Ugh..."
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "02b6540f",
"en_raw": "So in the end, Yuasa"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "d4afd333",
"en_raw": "got the better of you"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "1cb1e84a",
"en_raw": "Well, I'm fine with it, but"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "24d10a61",
"en_raw": "you can't show your face in the"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "14d44a26",
"en_raw": "sun for a while"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "92904b32",
"en_raw": "The world of boys is harsh"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "c8f39742",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Courage Test"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "705b2c7d",
"en_raw": "Yuasa mistook Shiina for a ghost"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "8b0d03a6",
"en_raw": "and Nao fainted when he saw it"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "58168e7b",
"en_raw": "That's the unknown truth"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "c0407614",
"en_raw": "...So, how much will you pay?"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "aca59ffa",
"en_raw": "Well, for Nao's privacy"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "181340d1",
"en_raw": "I'll forget"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "e9f28fd3",
"en_raw": "this story"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}